  "description": "Reads Business Central data directly out of SQL Server native backups (.bak) and BC cloud exports (.bacpac), with no SQL Server, no restore or import, and no service tier. Lists tables, decodes rows including page compression and off-page LOBs, resolves AL field names from SymbolReference.json, and answers many reads over one open file in serve mode.",
